255 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 137 0 R
/E (Keep the runs as short and direct as practical, avoid low points where condensation or oil can collect, and route the hoses clear of exhaust components, turbo housings and moving parts. Assemble the solenoid as shown in the above picture with the supplied accessories. Mount the solenoid to a solid bracket with the ports facing downwards, away from direct heat, and allow enough hose length that engine movement doesn't tension the lines. Use the supplied silicone hose and hose clamps. Note the solenoid bracket is reversible should you want to bolt it from the bottom.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
256 0 obj
<<
