392 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 150 0 R
/E (Engine safety for any metric is treated in 2 steps being warning and cut. Warning  will be displayed, where possible by turning the respective digits green in colour. Where not possible e.g. an aux in warning on single display mode, will display a W to the right of the sidbar. In any case. A cut will set the duty cycle to 0% to dump all boost and will display the yellow safety symbol as above. )
/Pg 28 0 R
